    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a slump though. i can see the ceiling. i can see exactly where i stop being good. it’s like looking at a cliff edge. if i keep going, i'm just going to spend the rest of my life being mediocre and watching my legacy rot. wouldn't it be better to just step away now while the work still means something?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
