    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, there is no \"new self.\" there's just the decline. i'm tired of fighting it. it feels more dignified to just exit the stage while people still remember my best work, rather than dragging this corpse of a career out for another twenty years. i'd rather end the story on a high note than let it turn into a pathetic, slow fade-out.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
